# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The internships page was folded into Careers, but the old URL has been live,
# is in the sitemap Google already crawled, and may be in job posts, emails and
# LinkedIn comments. A 301 keeps every one of those links working and passes the
# ranking to the section that replaced it, instead of handing people a 404 in
# the middle of applying.
/internships       /careers#internships   301
/internships.html  /careers#internships   301
